# Production build env (loaded by `vite build`).
# The Google OAuth *Web* client ID is PUBLIC by design — it is already exposed
# in the shipped client bundle, so committing it here is safe and lets CI builds
# (Cloudflare, etc.) work with no dashboard configuration. The real secret (the
# Gemini API key) is NEVER in the repo — each parent enters it at runtime.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=968668540137-lippialc2dhi72o668e9aa8jsmo5g8k1.apps.googleusercontent.com
